Cell["\<\
This block assumes that the following already exist :
 \t  -surfaceGrid 
\t  - nCurves, nPts 
 \t  - normalAt[i, j] 
\t  - patchAreaAt[i, j] 
\t  - firstTubeHit[p, r, rayLen] 
